 intro="NISM Series I certifies people who deal in or advise on exchange-traded currency derivatives. It covers how the forex market works, how futures and options are priced and traded, how positions are margined and settled, and the rules that apply.",
 who="Dealers, sales and advisory staff at brokers, bank treasury and forex desks, corporate treasury teams and compliance staff working with currency derivatives.",
